      "start": "00:02",
      "end": "00:06",
      "speech": "It's a concept in psychology called labor illusion."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06",
      "end": "00:09",
      "speech": "And you might be thinking, people hate waiting, why would this work?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09",
      "end": "00:13",
      "speech": "Well, researchers ran a study where they had two groups use the same travel website."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13",
      "end": "00:15",
      "speech": "One group got instant results."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15",
