    },
    {
      "start": "00:21",
      "end": "00:25",
      "speech": "But the group that waited actually rated the service higher because they perceived this level of effort."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25",
      "end": "00:27",
      "speech": "TurboTax does this on purpose."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27",
      "end": "00:31",
      "speech": "After you submit your return, it says checking, checking for any possible tax breaks."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31",
      "end": "00:33",
      "speech": "That check on the back end is almost instant."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33",
      "end": "00:36",
