      "end": "00:41",
      "speech": "When you press a button at the casino, the results are already determined."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41",
      "end": "00:45",
      "speech": "A random number generator locks the outcome in milliseconds."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:45",
      "end": "00:47",
      "speech": "The spinning reels are just for animation."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:47",
      "end": "00:50",
      "speech": "But here, the fake wait isn't about trust, it's about anticipation."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:50",
      "end": "00:53",
      "speech": "The longer the reels spin, the more invested you become in the outcome."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53",
      "end": "00:55",
      "speech": "Now, not every loading screen is fake."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55",
      "end": "00:57",
      "speech": "A lot of times the app is genuinely doing work."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57",
      "end": "01:00",
      "speech": "Searching a database, calling an API, processing a file."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00",
      "end": "01:04",
      "speech": "That takes real time, and sometimes even if you optimize things, it still takes time."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04",
      "end": "01:07",
      "speech": "But the point is showing effort in the wait makes people trust it more."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07",
      "end": "01:10",
      "speech": "Something to think about the next time you're staring at a loading screen."
    }
  ],
  "visual_demonstrations": [
